TuxSCR
======

TuxSCR is a C++ rewriting of ConvImgCpc, a picture converter for the Amstrad
CPC written in C# by Ludovic Deplanque (Demoniak), copyright (c) Demoniak
2020:

    https://github.com/IMPact-Scene/ConvImgCpc

ConvImgCpc's sources are public, but come with no licence text: the rights
to it are its author's. TuxSCR follows those sources closely (its conversion,
its file formats, the Z80 routines it puts in the screens it saves, the
texts of its windows). It is therefore not to be distributed without its
author's agreement.

The palette interrupts of the CPC Plus, and the windows as they are here,
are TuxSCR's own.


